# Copy to .env.local (which git ignores) to use it.
#
# Optional. An ArcGIS API key for the Satellite basemap (Esri World Imagery).
# Leave it empty for local development: the imagery loads without a key.
# Set it before publishing the site, and restrict the key to your site's
# address (referrer) in the ArcGIS dashboard, because the key is visible to
# anyone who opens the built site.
VITE_ESRI_KEY=
